{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "da3ed389452e4bba9deb31558ef0c67896ba9298c0f25b2f424d944e397ccaca", "ja": "麗花、ブログの更新ありがとう。\n写真も綺麗に撮れてたな。", "zh": "丽花，谢谢你更新博客。照片也拍得很漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "dd22c53fc8cf5624be218a4ef1ac05a057e00f3d17a4f389570c41e77ef09d7c", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかったです♪　今ちょうど、\nあの写真をお母さんにも送ったところです。", "zh": "真的吗？那太好了♪我刚刚正好把那张照片也发给妈妈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "b363ff299beb53bd4bd19d36b1bfc0e281d9a5a636142a3dde36aeee1ade24c2", "ja": "そしたら「あら、どこに登りに行くの？」って。\nせっかくなので、登ってこようかと。", "zh": "然后她就说：“哎呀，你要去哪里爬山呀？”\n难得有这个机会，我就想着要不要去爬一爬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "488098c2bf352bb404808163536333124aafeb721c5cefa86fbd3e198264e708", "ja": "どこにしようかな～♪", "zh": "去哪里好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8a28ccb90eee17bc009aa921bdcfe9fa276b4e0705d54ca6b635d8c9caa664b6", "ja": "登りって……もしかして、山登りの事か？\n衣装で？", "zh": "你说的登山……难道是爬山吗？\n穿着演出服去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "0c9eb8dddc4c4770f76ca1a6addebbfedeb561d3c3b16213ea45d0943f6ccf55", "ja": "はい！　この衣装、とっても動きやすいですし。\nそれに丈夫そうだし♪", "zh": "是的！这身服装非常方便活动。\n而且看起来也很结实♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0fe9bd13edb52c478c7e821ca9ec9840cda9e12b9263d5672372b071769b7a6c", "ja": "いや、ステージ衣装だから、実際の山での\n実用性とか防寒性までは考えてないかも……。", "zh": "不过，毕竟是演出服，可能并没有考虑到\n在真正的山里的实用性和保暖性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a9204d2407ecbe2bf599716717f2c34092f725d743feaee14d58c81e08d8bb0", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　残念……。じゃあじゃあ、\n登山にはお気に入りのキャンプウェアで行きますね。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？真遗憾……那么那么，登山时我就穿自己最喜欢的露营服去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d079fcebfad84407cce9c90597875d06da95570511dfed789a2cc383ac3ea6ca", "ja": "その方がいいな。けど、麗花は本当に\n山が好きなんだな。ご家族の影響なのか？", "zh": "那样更好。不过，丽花真的很喜欢山啊。是受家人的影响吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "33b5ef61ee1c288c0a7fe9ad5a0876a53343c99fcf3022e31f491f56fe8c023f", "ja": "うーん、そうかも？\n小さいころは、家族でキャンプに行ったりしましたし。", "zh": "嗯——也许吧？\n我小时候，家里人也会带我去露营什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "d6bae36070b3414f63b50bb47b2a015fb8faaba873979c4a0c98ab85de0a3bba", "ja": "お母さんから歌を教えてもらって、\nお父さんと3人で歌ったり……。", "zh": "妈妈教我唱歌，还和爸爸以及3个人一起唱过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1011_p", "source_sha256": "73ecdc962e2c91ae23b831da0a437d77513da92abbeb9b8b3204b42b15d492ac", "ja": "なるほど……麗花のお母さんは、たしかオペラ歌手\nだったな。そんな風に歌を教えてくれたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此……丽花的妈妈记得是歌剧歌手。她就是这样教你唱歌的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "6e8b939f6275a23729bdd222c57f76140366a35b5242face369d4eb1d57fda3f", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね！\nお母さんと山で歌うのは、とっても楽しかったです。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊！\n和妈妈一起在山里唱歌，特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "f831fa81c22c9eb1c337bac625bb88a96527e67dab238cf0cf67271e3bde39fc", "ja": "お父さんが作るご飯も、おいしくて。夜はテントで、\nみんなでぎゅーってして眠るんですよ♪", "zh": "爸爸做的饭也很好吃。晚上大家在帐篷里紧紧挨在一起睡觉哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1014_p", "source_sha256": "44fb37e07ae39f6390585355445f2117d795463eb0ed282a4faa0d762fc41367", "ja": "ははっ、なんとなくイメージが浮かぶよ。\n北上家のキャンプは楽しそうだな。", "zh": "哈哈，不知怎么就浮现出那个画面了。\n北上家的露营听起来很开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "b80232cbcc6e8d78d8f80584590a1b0edbed6e1d7137addf30336cd081d0e171", "ja": "はい、とっても楽しいですよ！　でも最近は、\nお母さんと私のお休みが合わなくて……。", "zh": "是的，特别开心！不过最近妈妈和我的休息日总是对不上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "101582937c1617c4e22049ec022e926421ffb9268e9867e22946db560518f206", "ja": "お母さんとお父さんが海外のお仕事に行っちゃうと、\nなかなか会えなかったりするんです。", "zh": "要是妈妈和爸爸去国外工作，就会很难见到他们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "aca624b2e9bee0138ed65613f5c5c5ab6eec4949a66fd90334adb3a347f319a0", "ja": "あっ……そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\n今度私と、キャンプに行きませんか？", "zh": "啊……对了！{$P$}先生，下次要不要和我一起去露营？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "6cf653806bcc6e662aed9ad5a88b9d00b06375af61c817290ae3c685925e1e14", "ja": "{$P$}さんとだったら、きっと\n家族と行くのと同じくらい楽しいと思います♪", "zh": "如果是和{$P$}先生一起去的话，\n肯定能和跟家人去的时候一样开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "bea9a13dd36b4166d787d48ffb932e98f2429ade7b71f9591e8362c74b20adb3", "ja": "山を登った先で、知らない景色を見るのも、\n歌を歌うのも、とっても楽しくて気持ちいいですよ！", "zh": "登上山顶后，看看未曾见过的景色，\n再唱上几句歌，真的非常开心又舒畅哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e9bccfb6ff2be78cbfe01a3fa39f9a09b9c30f7c19a7c9af581290c6b2f5385f", "ja": "まだ見ぬ山からの景色か……うん、いいな。\nわかった、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "未曾见过的山间景色吗……嗯，听起来不错。\n知道了，我很期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
